#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:2
msgid "Full HA Upgrade"
msgstr "Mise à niveau Full HA"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:4
msgid ""
"Full HA configurations represent multiple app nodes with external (non-"
"system) MySQL, RabbitMQ and Elasticsearch Clusters or Services."
msgstr "Les configurations Full HA représentent plusieurs nœuds d'application avec des clusters ou services MySQL, RabbitMQ et Elasticsearch externes (non système)."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:7
msgid "|morpheus| Packages"
msgstr "|morpheus| Packages"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:8
msgid ""
"|morpheus| Release Package urls can be obtained from "
"`https://app.morpheushub.com <https://app.morpheushub.com>`_"
msgstr "Les URL des packages de version |morpheus| peuvent être obtenues depuis `https://app.morpheushub.com <https://app.morpheushub.com>`_"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:12
msgid ""
"When upgrading to |morphver| only services local to the Morpheus App "
"node(s) will be upgraded. For fully distributed configurations (Full HA) "
"where MySQL, RabbitMQ and Elasticsearch are external, the upgrade process"
" will not upgrade these services."
msgstr "Lors de la mise à niveau vers |morphver|, seuls les services locaux aux nœuds d'application Morpheus seront mis à niveau. Pour les configurations entièrement distribuées (Full HA) où MySQL, RabbitMQ et Elasticsearch sont externes, le processus de mise à niveau ne mettra pas à niveau ces services."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:14
msgid ""
"Refer to :ref:`compatibility` for externalized MySQL, Elasticsearch "
"and/or RabbitMQ version requirements."
msgstr "Consultez :ref:`compatibility` pour les exigences de version MySQL, Elasticsearch et/ou RabbitMQ externalisés."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/overview.rst:17
msgid "Upgrade Instructions"
msgstr "Instructions de mise à niveau"

